## Open Defects (Carried Forward + Confirmed)

### DEF-TB-2026-03-19-001 — OPEN (reconfirmed 2026-03-20)
**Title:** Site Intelligence locality conflicts with canonical Project Address; jurisdiction stays blank  
**Severity:** Medium  
**Evidence:** CRM address `Tucson, AZ 85704` → Site Intelligence shows `Pima, Oro Valley`. Jurisdiction dropdown remains `Select jurisdiction`.  
**Designer impact:** Cannot determine which location truth is authoritative.

### DEF-TB-2026-03-19-002 — OPEN (reconfirmed 2026-03-20)
**Title:** Manual Project Address correction silently overwritten by CRM re-parse  
**Severity:** High  
**Evidence:** Manual correction to `4828 W Condor Dr` accepted → downstream updates → CRM re-parse reverts everything to `8880 N Camino Coronado` with zero warning.  
**Designer impact:** Corrections don't stick; routine workflow silently rewinds the job.

### DEF-005 (existing scope) — NOTED
**Title:** City/state/zip stripping from Project Address  
**Evidence:** CRM contains `8880 N Camino Coronado, Tucson, AZ 85704` → field shows `8880 N Camino Coronado` only.  
**Status:** Known Track B scope item, not new.

